SUMMARY:Deliverage | Ep. 1 - Nothing Suspicious Happening in This Alley,
 Officer
DESCRIPTION:A brand-new series begins, and everything is completely
 legitimate. We're simply making deliveries. At night. In suspicious
 alleys. Please stop asking questions and definitely don't look in the
 package. Deliverage is a hardcore open-world PvP delivery game where every
 shipment is a gamble. Fight other players for valuable cargo, repair and
 modify fragile vehicles, outplay rivals in a shifting economy, and climb
 from nothing to the top of a ruthless world.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=08BiB4Nn4aA
CATEGORIES:Deliverage
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
