DTSTART:20260822T203000Z
DTEND:20260822T223000Z
SUMMARY:Fallout 4 | Ep. 59 - Come for the Seafood, Stay Because Something
 Ate Your Boat
DESCRIPTION:The Far Harbor tourism board really needs to work on its
 messaging. We're heading deeper into the fog for more mysteries, monsters,
 radioactive sightseeing, and potentially disastrous decisions. As the sole
 survivor of Vault 111, you enter a world destroyed by nuclear war. Every
 second is a fight for survival, and every choice is yours. Only you can
 rebuild and determine the fate of the Wasteland. Welcome home.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZNrop7NmSU
CATEGORIES:Fallout 4
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
