SUMMARY:Construction Simulator | Ep. 44 - All This Work So Someone Can
 Stop for a Sandwich
DESCRIPTION:We're back on the construction site, putting countless hours,
 tonnes of materials, and enormous pieces of heavy machinery into creating
 something truly important: somewhere people can stop for a sandwich.
 Construction Simulator is back - bigger and better than ever! Take charge
 of over 70 machines, dozens of them brand new to the franchise, and build
 to your heart's content on two huge maps - on your own or with your
 friends!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FtY8gO2_Dio
CATEGORIES:Construction Simulator
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24322211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260804T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260826T221800Z
DTSTART:20260825T203000Z
DTEND:20260825T223000Z
SUMMARY:WET | Ep. 3 - The Walls Are Just Extra Footpaths
DESCRIPTION:Rubi returns for another evening of spectacularly unnecessary
 acrobatics, cinematic gunfights, slow-motion action, and further proof
 that floors are apparently optional. A stylish action shooter that blends
 fast-paced gunplay, sword combat, and cinematic acrobatics. Players follow
 mercenary Rubi Malone as she takes on dangerous jobs, battling through
 waves of enemies using slow-motion stunts inspired by classic action
 films. Expect explosive set pieces, over-the-top action, and plenty of
 style.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9JXX3u5pPps
CATEGORIES:WET
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24342211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260806T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260826T221800Z
DTSTART:20260827T203000Z
DTEND:20260827T223000Z
SUMMARY:Waterpark Simulator | Ep. 1 - Welcome to the Waterpark, Waivers
 Are by the Entrance
DESCRIPTION:Back into the mysterious forest with Cereza and Cheshire for
 more magical exploration, puzzles, strange creatures, and continued
 negotiations over what we're absolutely not taking home with us. Dive into
 the fun of running your very own waterpark! Design and expand your park,
 build exciting pools and attractions, keep your guests happy, and deal
 with the chaos that comes with managing a busy summer destination. From
 creating the perfect waterpark to handling the unexpected, it's time to
 see if we can turn our park into the ultimate place for fun in the sun.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Waterpark Simulator
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
