SUMMARY:Red Dead Redemption II | Ep. 18 - Saint Denis Ain't No Place for
 Men Like Us
DESCRIPTION:Our journey through Saint Denis continues as civilisation
 closes in around the gang. The streets are crowded, the law is everywhere,
 and trouble never seems very far away. Arthur Morgan and the Van der Linde
 Gang are outlaws on the run. With federal agents and bounty hunters
 massing on their heels, the gang must rob, steal, and fight their way
 across the rugged heartland in order to survive.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Red Dead Redemption II
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
