SUMMARY:Fallout 4 | Ep. 60 - Going Where Todd Howard Never Intended
DESCRIPTION:Sixty episodes into Fallout 4, and apparently the Commonwealth
 still hasn't learned to keep me contained. Tonight we're heading beyond
 sensible exploration and discovering what happens when curiosity beats
 self-preservation. As the sole survivor of Vault 111, you enter a world
 destroyed by nuclear war. Every second is a fight for survival, and every
 choice is yours. Only you can rebuild and determine the fate of the
 Wasteland. Welcome home.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Fallout 4
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
